# hunks:
#   NO STYLING HUNK AT ALL. `Message` is six plain `<div>`s with a class each — no control, no
#     focus affordance, no cursor, no disabled state, no live region and no portal — so not one
#     row in the exception map reaches it. A11Y-2: audited and not applicable; nothing here is a
#     pointer target. `message.test.tsx` asserts the part list, the `align` switch and the
